142:### 2.4 `eval-ops`
143-
144-Use when:
145-- release or rollout decisions depend on measurable criteria
146-- regression, drift, anomaly, or canary interpretation matters
147-- scorecard, rubric, or gate logic is central
--
157-- `PROMPT_tool_protocol_overlay` when evaluating tool workflows
158-- `PROMPT_guardrails_safety_overlay` when safety-surface evaluation matters materially
159-- `PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay` when the evaluation depends on external evidence, docs, or current artifacts
160-- `PROMPT_memory_adaptation_overlay` when repeated monitoring or longitudinal comparison needs compact checkpoint continuity
